    13. Empty literals

    con names: List<String> = []      [] needs a type, like null

    For maps, {} next to Allman braces:

    a) (R) {} with a written type: con ages: Map<String, Int> = {}
    b)     Map<String, Int>() only, so {} is never a map.
------------------------------------------------------------------ */

