    14. print and String() of lists and maps

    a) (R) [1, 2, 3]   ["a", "b"]   {"Ada": 36}
           Strings inside a collection are quoted, so ["a, b"] and
           ["a", "b"] look different.
    b)     [1, 2, 3]   [a, b]       {Ada: 36}
------------------------------------------------------------------ */

